. * --- (4) Winter Severity Index (Kohn 1975 / WI DNR definition, 
> per the ---
. * --- literature review): sum of (a) # days Dec 1-Apr 30 with mi
> n temp
. * --- <=0F, and (b) # days Dec 1-Apr 30 with >=18in snow depth o
> n the
. * --- ground. A day meeting both conditions counts in both talli
> es, which
. * --- is exactly the "adds 2 points" rule in the literature quot
> e -- no
. * --- special-case code needed, it falls out of summing the two 
> counts.
. * --- Window is Dec(t-1) through Apr(t) -- wider than the 3-mont
> h DJF
. * --- window used for mean_winter_temp above.
. gen wsi_cold_days = L1.days_extremely_cold_m12 ///
